            <ArticleTitle>Quadrilateral space syndrome.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>109-12</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We studied 4 cases of quadrilateral space syndrome. Though the syndrome is quite uncommon, it might be discovered by examination of the patient complaining of pain of neck and shoulder especially when the tenderness in the quadrilateral space. Early surgical decompression is indicated as soon as diagnosis is made.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
